          prompt: "Apply it: run a Think Tank session. Get 3 random words (open a dictionary 3 times or use a random-word generator) and force each into an ad angle for PMT or a Sacramento trade.",
          fields: ["Your three random words:", "Three angles, one per word (headline + first line):", "Which one is a keeper, and why?"],
