        body: "The before is a discount-store, thrill-seeker environment. To a nervous beginner the wheelie says “this is for people who already ride,” and the shouting says “pressure.” The after builds PMT's back room: calm, patient, competent and honest, which is exactly the mood in which a scared beginner hands over money for a class."
